# /image (/img) and /images on a model whose catalog row reads images
# (tool-use, vision, file-input): every refusal, the badge, the badges kept
# under a command typed after them, Ctrl-U dropping one, the prompt that sends
# them, the request after it re-sending them, and a resume re-sending them
# again. `huge.png` is 21 MiB with a PNG signature, made at launch.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
sparsepng huge.png 22020096
wait 3
type /image
key Enter
wait 1
snap bare
type /image nope.png
key Enter
wait 1
snap missing
type /image notes.txt
key Enter
wait 1
snap unsupported
type /image huge.png
key Enter
wait 1
snap toolarge
type /image pics
key Enter
wait 1
snap directory
type /images
key Enter
wait 1
snap images-empty
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap attached
type  /images
key Enter
wait 1
snap images-listed
type  /images clear
key Enter
wait 1
snap images-cleared
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 1
key C-u
wait 0.5
snap cu
type /images
key Enter
wait 1
snap images-after-cu
type /img shot.png
key Enter
wait 1
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 1
snap two-attached
type  what is in this image?
key Enter
wait 4
snap sent
type describe it again
key Enter
wait 4
snap again
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 5
snap resumed
type once more
key Enter
wait 4
snap resumed-sent
snapfull end
gwlog
home end
